{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q34", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主的两名小孩在哪一年出生？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，需木火生扶。时柱乙巳，乙木生丁火，巳火为根，但整体身弱。子女星看食伤（土）与官杀（水）。女命以食伤为子女，原局土星不显，需大运流年引出。\n\n命主1980年生，当前大运（假设40岁后）可能行水木运。子女出生年份需结合流年引动子女星。选项中，2013年（癸巳）、2015年（乙未）为水木年，且未土为食神，巳火为比劫，可能生女孩；2017年（丁酉）、2019年（己亥）中，酉为偏财，亥为官杀，可能生男孩。但需看命主实际生育年龄，通常30-35岁左右。2013年命主33岁，2015年35岁，符合生育期，且这两年天干癸、乙，地支巳、未，与命局乙巳、乙酉有合冲，引动子女宫，且均为女孩可能性大（因食伤透干为阴土）。因此推断为两个女孩。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q34", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_off_r1_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4086, "response_id": "d82fa24f-1be2-4514-8e26-bcfc414bfca8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 272, "total_tokens": 508, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
